      "audio_sha256": "7c34899a2c59a6bfca7d9263999a9622053fea6dbb78f3963e78487fb84bc63e",
      "query_sha256": "8ea3ae61cffaff2301be4310fe5553b59d6c21086cc4ffcd40693a90174fc690"
    },
    {
      "text": "でも、利益が減った理由を聞いて、利益を増やす目標が出ても、答えにはなりません。",
      "audio": "02-mismatch.wav",
      "query": "02-mismatch.query.json",
      "speech_duration": 6.496,
      "speaker_id": 14,
      "speaker_uuid": "8eaad775-3119-417e-8cf4-2a10bfd592c8",
      "key": "e0937001d7ec3538c4cc5ff0020d81d8f6c466a7fdea2833370feb59b2447b23",
      "audio_sha256": "47884c4cb95ab6b73b9285f6da9d2e198d2399c62a9d6d622df5cdae9fe507da",
      "query_sha256": "22612695b28d8848f8cacbee657ccb1e718f7bb34a1d30d0aaa59482da013cdb"
    },
    {
      "text": "ページインデックスは、資料をしょうやせつのツリーに整理。",
      "audio": "03-structure.wav",
      "query": "03-structure.query.json",
      "speech_duration": 3.7226666666666666,
      "speaker_id": 14,
      "speaker_uuid": "8eaad775-3119-417e-8cf4-2a10bfd592c8",
      "key": "f778b5278c326fc7db8540c03ff58affe6b23dbd22139f63e1bebc1c84c990c2",
      "audio_sha256": "98a4f5f14e7bb8c06f2caccc5cf47624d3b335d6c4cf13a66114aa7287d25a36",
      "query_sha256": "68dc9f293c2408a1159c5d4067ff8beb06c4d079f4025180873b25ea7c6b7cc9"
    },
    {
      "text": "決算資料から、業績、費用の分析へ。しょうの説明を手がかりに、AIが読む場所を選びます。",
      "audio": "04-traverse.wav",
      "query": "04-traverse.query.json",
      "speech_duration": 7.648,
      "speaker_id": 14,
      "speaker_uuid": "8eaad775-3119-417e-8cf4-2a10bfd592c8",
      "key": "e4cb90fdd556321a3f0212093009ae2d693a3a310c91709d3a1ed3ebb5b4148c",
      "audio_sha256": "b9cc74729dc9d58fb160159d3723ba0d81a3c0fce9cc937c679a9cd05aeeb332",
      "query_sha256": "39b71af4a4204d9e99d7bec7c7a33d83af181b3b524312b6180cdf34ee2f9d08"
    },
    {
      "text": "本文に、物流費の増加で利益が減った、とあれば、そのページを根拠に回答します。",
      "audio": "05-evidence.wav",
      "query": "05-evidence.query.json",
      "speech_duration": 6.474666666666667,
      "speaker_id": 14,
      "speaker_uuid": "8eaad775-3119-417e-8cf4-2a10bfd592c8",
      "key": "e2991a3a3f63a1fafa35a623e2910dc200c158812cef966d1c9a6cda005a825c",
      "audio_sha256": "0eb6dc5a6dfa37716a5086fa3def01ebd99dcc89915b66420ef11b28025dfecc",
      "query_sha256": "3781caf648fc1a6df892f5104d856a7f33ecc23c2a259be7a2a755c6d3872e05"
    },
    {
      "text": "似た文章を探すだけでなく、構造をたどって探す。ベクトルデータベースを使わないのが特徴です。",
      "audio": "06-principle.wav",
      "query": "06-principle.query.json",
      "speech_duration": 7.168,
      "speaker_id": 14,
      "speaker_uuid": "8eaad775-3119-417e-8cf4-2a10bfd592c8",
      "key": "1f9e7a7b5a885653a44b8bd6c5bea1836178b140b47d56f34c2d59e9ffd60cb6",
      "audio_sha256": "4d151534aa156267c759ad41685e9989908e9c35239f491872835d961febc4a6",
      "query_sha256": "9f9519104e112928475594f90653d66b70229f07704717896b1d85d97ac0d70d"
    },
    {
      "text": "ただし、万能ではありません。精度も、待ち時間も、AIの利用コストも、検証が必要です。",
      "audio": "07-limits.wav",
      "query": "07-limits.query.json",
      "speech_duration": 7.68,
